OL,3,GNEWSAFire crews tackle blaze at Glasgow
OL,4,Arecycling centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FFire crews have left the scene of a
OL,7,Fblaze at a recycling facility in
OL,8,FGlasgow.
OL,10,FThree appliances and a high reach
OL,11,Fvehicle were dispatched to Shieldhall
OL,12,FRecycling Centre on Bogmoor Road.
OL,14,FThe Scottish Fire and Rescue Service
OL,15,Fsaid they were called to the scene at
OL,16,Fabout 10:35 on Saturday, but left at
OL,17,Fabout 16:00.
OL,19,FLocal residents and those not in the
OL,20,Fimmediate area who could either see or
OL,21,Fsmell smoke were encouraged to keep
OL,22,Ftheir windows and doors closed.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
